    "created_at": "2025-05-10T06:10:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-10T06:10:01Z",
    "body": "This is already included in the spec. In fact, the spec requires `Sec-Purpose: prefetch`, and does not allow other headers like `Purpose: prefetch`.\n\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-prefetch:~:text=Set%20request's%20initiator%20to%20%22prefetch%22.\n- https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#:~:text=If%20httpRequest%E2%80%99s%20initiator%20is%20%22prefetch%22%2C%20then%20set%20a%20structured%20field%20value%20given%20(%60Sec%2DPurpose%60%2C%20the%20token%20prefetch)%20in%20httpRequest%E2%80%99s%20header%20list.",
